\n</u><u>E me lava num abraço quando estou sujo e descalço\r\n\r\n</u><u>                  <i>A</i>\r\n</u><u>Eu tive raiva de mim\r\n</u><u>         <i>D</i>\r\n</u><u>Sempre achei que era melhor\r\n</u><u>                     <i>A</i>\r\n</u><u>Tira essa raiva de mim\r\n</u><u>    <i>D</i>\r\n</u><u>Eu não consigo só\r\n</u><u>     <i>E</i>\r\n</u><u>E então eu voarei pra casa\r\n\r\n</u><u>    <i>F#m</i>                         <i>A</i>\r\n</u><b>E|---------------------------------------|\r\n</b><b>B|--7-7-7-7-7/2-2-2-2--------------------|\r\n</b><b>G|---------------------2-2-2-2-2-2-2-2---|\r\n</b><b>D|---------------------------------------|\r\n</b><b>A|---------------------------------------|\r\n</b><b>E|---------------------------------------|\r\n\r\n</b><u>    <i>D</i>\r\n</u><b>E|-------------------------------------|\r\n</b><b>B|3-3-3-3------------------------------|\r\n</b><b>G|-----------2-2-2-2-------------------|\r\n</b><b>D|-------------------4-4-4-4-4-4-4-4---|\r\n</b><b>A|-------------------------------------|\r\n</b><b>E|-------------------------------------|\r\n\r\n</b><u>    <i>F#m</i>                         <i>A</i>\r\n</u><b>E|---------------------------------------|\r\n</b><b>B|--7-7-7-7-7/2-2-2-2--------------------|\r\n</b><b>G|---------------------2-2-2-2-2-2-2-2---|\r\n</b><b>D|---------------------------------------|\r\n</b><b>A|---------------------------------------|\r\n</b><b>E|---------------------------------------|\r\n\r\n</b><u>    <i>D</i>\r\n</u><b>E|---------------------------------------|\r\n</b><b>B|3-3-3-3--------------------------------|\r\n</b><b>G|-----------2-2-2-2---------------------|\r\n</b><b>D|-------------------4-4-4-4-4-4-2-2h4---|\r\n</b><b>A|---------------------------------------|\r\n</b><b>E|---------------------------------------|\r\n\r\n</b><u>      <i>F#m</i>                          <i>A</i>            <i>D</i>    <i>F#m</i>\r\n</u><u>O que tira a minha paz não é a falta do que eu gosto\r\n</u><u><i>F#m</